@startuml 04f-theory
' 图 04F：Lean 签名准入理论 ↔ control-plane 工程映射。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title 图 04F · 签名准入理论 ↔ @cantilune/control-plane 工程映射
caption <color:#6E6963>锚点：Admission.lean · Package.lean · formal-semantics。抽象 04H。</color>

top to bottom direction

rectangle "理论层（Lean / RFC）" #EDE8F0 {
  card "FinSignature σ\nSignatureExtension 单调扩展" as T0
  card "SignatureAdmissionEvent\nfromVersion < toVersion" as T1
  card "FourViewAdmission\nDAG·Petri·π·Morphism Extends" as T2
  card "ExecutionPackage\nepoch · ranking · deletion 门控" as T3
}

rectangle "@cantilune/control-plane\n六层治理" #F3E5DC {
  card "G1 SchemaRevision\nmonotoneExtensionValidator" as G1
  card "G3 submit/approve\nSchemaAdmissionRecord" as G3
  card "G4 prepare/commit\nPreparedSchemaAdmission" as G4
  card "G2 SchemaEpochBinding\nbindingGeneration CAS" as G2
  card "G5 PolicyRevision · HandlerManifest" as G5
  card "G6 Fleet Reconciliation" as G6
}

rectangle "协作包（已落地）" #E5EDE5 {
  card "@cantilune/conformance\nFourViewEvidenceBundle" as Conf
  card "@cantilune/runtime\nRuntimeEpochAdministration" as RT
  card "@cantilune/core\nSchemaEpochBinding 品牌类型" as Core
}

rectangle "不在 control-plane" #F5F1EB {
  card "@cantilune/runtime\n单步 admit/commit Change" as RTex
  card "@cantilune/observability\n四投影只读 derive" as Obs
}

T0 --> G1
T1 --> G3
T1 --> G4
T2 --> Conf
T2 --> G4
T3 --> RT

G1 --> G3
G3 --> G4
G4 --> G2
G4 --> RT
Conf --> G4
Core --> G2
G2 --> G6
G5 --> G2

RTex ..> RT : epoch 切换后 runtime 用新 schema
Obs ..> Conf : 证据可来自 observability 派生

note right of G4
  <b>分工</b>
  control-plane = 治理决策 + 绑定 CAS
  runtime epochAdmin = 世界 quiescence +
  snapshot epoch 物理切换
end note

note right of T2
  prepare 路径强制
  verifyFourViewEvidence
  对应 FourViewAdmission 工程存证
end note

footer runtime 单步 execute 见 02H · observability 只读 03H

@enduml
